    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n105606" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τροχιά</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>wheel-track, rut,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phot.
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>the round of a wheel,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				AP
				7.478
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Leon.
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				9.418
			</span></i> (Antip.), <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Th.</u>
				816
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>path,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Pr.</u>
				4.26
			</span></i> ( =
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>Ep.Hebr.</u>
				12.13
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
			<i>elastic strand in the</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τόνος</span>”
				<i>of a torsion-engine,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					<u>Bel.</u>
					54.41
				</span></i>
			, prob. for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τριχέα</span> in <i><span class="en">
				Hero
				<u>Bel.</u>
				108.3
			</span></i>.</div>
